{"seq":2,"slug":"build-speed-optimization","title":"构建速度优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/build-time-performance/build-speed-optimization","wordCount":695,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"构建速度优化\">构建速度优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构建速度既影响开发者体验（启动、热更新是否跟手），也影响 CI 吞吐。优化的四个抓手：换用更快的编译器（esbuild 基于 Go、SWC 基于 Rust，把构建中的转换阶段从 JS 里搬出来）、缓存（webpack 持久化缓存、Vite 预构建缓存，避免重复编译未变部分）、并行处理（多线程/多进程编译）、以及缩小构建范围（精确的 include/exclude、开发与生产差异化配置）。衡量同样需要度量：记录冷启动、热更新与完整构建的时间基线，才能判断某项优化是否真的有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构建速度的重要性\">构建速度的重要性</h2><p>构建速度直接影响开发效率和 CI/CD 流水线的吞吐量。当开发服务器启动需要 30 秒、热更新需要 5 秒、CI 构建需要 10 分钟时，开发者的工作流将被严重打断。构建速度优化的目标是让开发服务器秒级启动、热更新毫秒级完成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[构建速度优化] --&gt; B[使用更快的编译器]&#10;    A --&gt; C[缓存策略]&#10;    A --&gt; D[并行处理]&#10;    A --&gt; E[减少构建范围]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;esbuild (Go)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;SWC (Rust)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[持久化缓存]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[增量构建]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[多线程编译]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[并行 loader]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[按需编译]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[排除不必要的文件]\">graph TD\n    A[构建速度优化] --&gt; B[使用更快的编译器]\n    A --&gt; C[缓存策略]\n    A --&gt; D[并行处理]\n    A --&gt; E[减少构建范围]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[\"esbuild (Go)\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"SWC (Rust)\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[持久化缓存]\n    C --&gt; C2[增量构建]\n    D --&gt; D1[多线程编译]\n    D --&gt; D2[并行 loader]\n    E --&gt; E1[按需编译]\n    E --&gt; E2[排除不必要的文件]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"现代构建工具性能对比\">现代构建工具性能对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>冷启动</th>\n<th>HMR</th>\n<th>生产构建</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>webpack 5</td>\n<td>JS</td>\n<td>10-30s</td>\n<td>1-5s</td>\n<td>30-120s</td>\n<td>生态成熟、配置灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vite</td>\n<td>JS/Go</td>\n<td>0.5-2s</td>\n<td>50-200ms</td>\n<td>10-30s</td>\n<td>开发极快、Rollup 打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turbopack</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>0.5-1s</td>\n<td>10-50ms</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>增量计算、Vercel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rspack</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>1-3s</td>\n<td>100-500ms</td>\n<td>5-15s</td>\n<td>webpack 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"vite-为什么这么快\">Vite 为什么这么快</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;webpack 开发模式&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;入口文件&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;构建完整 bundle&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[&quot;启动 dev server&quot;]&#10;        A3 --&gt; A4[&quot;浏览器请求&quot;]&#10;        Note1[&quot;所有文件打包后才能启动&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Vite 开发模式&quot;&#10;        B1[&quot;启动 dev server&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;浏览器请求&quot;]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[&quot;按需编译请求的模块&quot;]&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4[&quot;返回 ESM 模块&quot;]&#10;        Note2[&quot;利用浏览器原生 ESM,按需编译&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"webpack 开发模式\"\n        A1[\"入口文件\"] --&gt; A2[\"构建完整 bundle\"]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[\"启动 dev server\"]\n        A3 --&gt; A4[\"浏览器请求\"]\n        Note1[\"所有文件打包后才能启动\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Vite 开发模式\"\n        B1[\"启动 dev server\"] --&gt; B2[\"浏览器请求\"]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[\"按需编译请求的模块\"]\n        B3 --&gt; B4[\"返回 ESM 模块\"]\n        Note2[\"利用浏览器原生 ESM,按需编译\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"esbuild-与-swc\">esbuild 与 SWC</h2><h3 id=\"esbuild\">esbuild</h3><p>esbuild 使用 Go 语言编写，编译速度比传统 JavaScript 工具快 10-100 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import esbuild from &#39;esbuild&#39;;&#10;&#10;await esbuild.build({&#10;  entryPoints: [&#39;src/index.tsx&#39;],&#10;  bundle: true,&#10;  minify: true,&#10;  sourcemap: true,&#10;  splitting: true,&#10;  format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;  outdir: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;  target: [&#39;es2020&#39;],&#10;  loader: {&#10;    &#39;.png&#39;: &#39;file&#39;,&#10;    &#39;.svg&#39;: &#39;dataurl&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  define: {&#10;    &#39;process.env.NODE_ENV&#39;: &#39;&quot;production&quot;&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'esbuild'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esbuild.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entryPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minify: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sourcemap: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  splitting: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outdir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'es2020'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loader: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '.svg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dataurl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  define: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'process.env.NODE_ENV'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"production\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"swc\">SWC</h3><p>SWC 使用 Rust 编写，是 Babel 的高性能替代品。Next.js 默认使用 SWC 进行编译。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;jsc&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;parser&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;syntax&quot;: &quot;typescript&quot;,&#10;      &quot;tsx&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;decorators&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;transform&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;react&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;runtime&quot;: &quot;automatic&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;es2020&quot;,&#10;    &quot;minify&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;compress&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;mangle&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;minify&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;sourceMaps&quot;: true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"jsc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"parser\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"syntax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"typescript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"tsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"decorators\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"runtime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"automatic\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"es2020\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"minify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"compress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mangle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\